From 8d9caf01d7750b819db08c3d3e38bbe9a84f05dd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: localhost-copilot <318096335+localhost-copilot@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 14:59:03 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 5/6] media: trace capture provenance and encoder DMA ownership

Correlate independent exports by shared allocator and normalized physical
address; unknown IOMMU domains fail closed. Keep vb2 at object offset zero.
Record real submit, complete, cancel and capture reference transitions.
Trace events are disabled by default; enabled runs incur per-buffer events
and are kept separate from performance measurements. Host regressions
cover dual export identity, object layout and IRQ/stream ownership.

Signed-off-by: localhost-copilot <318096335+localhost-copilot@users.noreply.github.com>
